    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Price of Obsession is a game created by a single developer, where you control a character who, after wanting to make changes in their life, meets new people and shapes both their lives and their own. It\u2019s a choice-driven narrative with multiple endings, where your decisions truly affect the characters, determining who lives, who dies, and who you want to continue your life with. The game is inspired by adult visual novels and some of the best choice-based story games.</p>",
